Khua-torrent-piece-reset.patch adds a narrowly scoped atomic partial-piece
reset operation; received-chunk state and backing bytes are discarded together,
never while a chunk write or piece hash is in flight. The dependency's own
license is included in its source ZIP. The same patch raises the minimum
strategy-3 peer request pipeline to 32 chunks (512 KiB at the default chunk
size), clamped to the peer's advertised request limit. The existing adaptive
calculation and cancellation behavior remain unchanged.
